Task: 19
Title: Stage 8 acceptance agents
Phase: 3
Route: full
Slice: Slice 3d — Acceptance
Dependencies: None
Scope: Convert the six Stage 8 agent types: `qrspi-accept` (orchestrator — dispatches acceptance tester, coverage planner, and accept-review lenses, runs acceptance loop, triggers backward loop detection), `qrspi-acceptance-tester` (executes acceptance tests against implemented phases), `qrspi-coverage-planner` (plans test coverage for acceptance phase), `qrspi-review-accept-goal-traceability` (verifies acceptance criteria trace to goals), `qrspi-review-accept-spec` (reviews acceptance test specs), and `qrspi-review-accept-code-quality` (reviews code quality in acceptance context). All use pi agent type convention.
Acceptance Criteria: AC 6 (Stage 8 agent types), AC 7 (model tier frontmatter)
NFRs: NFR: Compatibility (model tier)
Gate Criteria: Phase 3 replan gate (Acceptance agents complete)
